WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.632 --> 00:00:14.375
Magda's giant robot grabbed Roxy and squeezed.

2
00:00:14.395 --> 00:00:16.716
"Let me go!"

3
00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:18.576
Roxy tried to break free.

4
00:00:19.537 --> 00:00:20.337
Magda laughed.

5
00:00:20.797 --> 00:00:25.038
"Never!" Whiz-hoo!

6
00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:27.339
Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

7
00:00:28.279 --> 00:00:29.960
A car flew off the robot's shoulder.

8
00:00:32.224 --> 00:00:33.184
"Yes!" Roxy fired again.

9
00:00:33.625 --> 00:00:37.466
Whiz-hoo! The arm broke off and fell to the ground.

10
00:00:38.147 --> 00:00:40.147
Roxy quickly wriggled out of the robot's grip.

11
00:00:40.688 --> 00:00:41.748
The robot looked around.

12
00:00:42.588 --> 00:00:44.989
It grabbed a huge crane and swung it at Roxy.

13
00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:47.150
Roxy dodged it.

14
00:00:48.391 --> 00:00:51.712
Suddenly she noticed a large, round object hanging from the crane.

15
00:00:51.732 --> 00:00:54.894
"That's a magnet," Roxy thought.

16
00:00:54.914 --> 00:00:57.375
"I bet it's super strong!"

17
00:00:58.535 --> 00:01:00.176
The robot swung the crane again.

18
00:01:02.292 --> 00:01:03.812
Roxy flew into the driver's seat.

19
00:01:05.833 --> 00:01:06.953
A button read Magnet.

20
00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:08.314
She pressed it.

21
00:01:09.094 --> 00:01:10.394
The magnet began to hum.

22
00:01:12.575 --> 00:01:14.635
Shuunk! The robot's foot jerked up.

23
00:01:15.476 --> 00:01:16.636
It stuck to the magnet!

24
00:01:17.096 --> 00:01:18.636
The robot hopped on the other foot.

25
00:01:18.656 --> 00:01:21.717
"You're stuck!"

26
00:01:21.757 --> 00:01:22.537
Roxy laughed.

27
00:01:23.538 --> 00:01:25.818
She flew out of the crane and knocked the robot down.

28
00:01:26.479 --> 00:01:28.559
Crash! The robot crumpled.

29
00:01:28.579 --> 00:01:31.680
"Grr!" Magda shouted.

30
00:01:32.276 --> 00:01:34.417
She crawled out from under the pile of cars.

31
00:01:35.118 --> 00:01:36.058
She raised her arms.

32
00:01:36.919 --> 00:01:39.000
The crane stood up and floated in midair.

33
00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:42.963
"Uh-oh." Roxy flew toward Magda.

34
00:01:43.823 --> 00:01:45.124
The villain swung her arms.

35
00:01:45.824 --> 00:01:47.185
The crane struck Roxy.

36
00:01:47.205 --> 00:01:51.247
"Ouch!" Roxy landed in a pile of tires.

37
00:01:52.148 --> 00:01:54.229
Just then two cars flew toward Roxy.

38
00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:56.371
She ducked under the tires.

39
00:01:57.151 --> 00:01:58.472
The cars bounced off them.

40
00:02:01.492 --> 00:02:03.333
Magda made a piece of scrap metal rise.

41
00:02:03.353 --> 00:02:05.895
"Now it's a hoverboard!"

42
00:02:06.716 --> 00:02:08.137
She hopped on and zoomed away.

43
00:02:09.097 --> 00:02:10.418
Roxy used her super breath.

44
00:02:10.919 --> 00:02:14.201
Whoo-oo-oosh! The tires rolled after Magda.

45
00:02:15.382 --> 00:02:17.023
The villain zigzagged to avoid them.

46
00:02:18.684 --> 00:02:21.326
But one tire bounced off an old washing machine.

47
00:02:22.527 --> 00:02:24.568
It flew and knocked Magda off her hoverboard.

48
00:02:24.588 --> 00:02:27.550
"Oof!" Magda said.

49
00:02:28.651 --> 00:02:29.632
Roxy flew fast.

50
00:02:30.304 --> 00:02:32.466
She grabbed a tire and slipped it over Magda.

51
00:02:32.486 --> 00:02:35.248
"I can't move my arms!"

52
00:02:36.309 --> 00:02:37.350
Magda stomped her foot.

53
00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:39.552
"This isn't fun anymore!"

54
00:02:39.572 --> 00:02:43.656
"You can have lots of fun in jail," Roxy said.

55
00:02:43.676 --> 00:02:47.559
"And trust me—your cell won't have metal bars!"

56
00:02:52.203 --> 00:02:54.265
Roxy returned to Mara's backyard with juice.

57
00:02:55.466 --> 00:02:57.288
Her friends were kicking a soccer ball around.

58
00:02:58.464 --> 00:03:01.226
"What happened to the Mara the Magnificent magic show?"

59
00:03:01.547 --> 00:03:02.267
Roxy asked.

60
00:03:02.287 --> 00:03:05.730
"Er Mara's face turned red.

61
00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.992
"I just know one trick.

62
00:03:08.533 --> 00:03:10.254
And Terrell guessed the secret.

63
00:03:10.654 --> 00:03:13.257
I used a magnet to make the coin dance."

64
00:03:13.277 --> 00:03:16.679
"It's still a great trick," Jack said.

65
00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:18.181
Terrell nodded.

66
00:03:18.201 --> 00:03:20.102
"Magnets are awesome.

67
00:03:20.603 --> 00:03:22.204
You can do so many things with them.

68
00:03:22.564 --> 00:03:23.345
Right, Roxy?"

69
00:03:23.365 --> 00:03:26.748
"Um Roxy gulped.

70
00:03:27.404 --> 00:03:28.947
"Does anybody want more juice?"
